    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) National assessment of Invasive Alien Species in Fiji 
2) 10 staff trained in biosecurity ( surveillance, prevention and control)
3) Eradication plan developed and implemented simultaneously on Taveuni, Qamea, Matagi and Laucala
4) 4 surveys of nesting sites for Giant Invasive Iguana Species  in 4 islands (Taveuni, Qamea, Matagi and Laucala)
5)  4 awareness and training workshops conducted annually (including inception workshop)</narrative>
